# ── Credential-shaped files ─────────────────────────────────────────
# browser_storage_state used to write 768 live auth cookies here as
# PLAINTEXT json, one `git add .` away from committing real credentials.
# It is now DPAPI-encrypted into ~/.echo/sessions (see echocrypt.cs), but these
# patterns stay as defence in depth: an unencrypted artifact should never be
# committable even if some future tool writes one.
storage-state*.json
storage-state*.json.enc
*storage-state*
*session-state*.json
*.json.enc
.echo/
